-        // Use the equation for setTargetAtTime to figure out when we are close to 0:
-        //
-        //   v(t) = exp(-t/tau)
-        //
-        // So find t such that exp(-t/tau) <= eps.  Thus t >= - tau * log(eps).
-        //
-        // For eps, use 1e-20 (kSetTargetZeroThreshold in AudioParamTimeline.cpp).
